0	section	Talking to Lady Servil
1	line	Player	Hi there. Looks like you're in some trouble.
1	line	Lady Servil	The cart? That's the least of my problems. I've got to find my family...
1	box	Before starting this quest, be aware that your combat level is lower than the recommended level of 50.
1	select	Start the Fight Arena quest?
1	option	Yes.
2	line	Player	Your family? Can I help?
2	line	Lady Servil	You'd be willing to?
2	line	Player	Of course. Tell me what happened.
2	line	Lady Servil	Well, I'm Lady Servil. I was travelling to Ardougne with my husband, Justin, and son, Sammy, when our cart broke on some rocks.
2	line	Lady Servil	Some of General Khazard's men spotted us and offered to help, but they demanded my husband and son fight in their arena first! We said no, but they took them anyway!
2	line	Player	General Khazard?
2	line	Lady Servil	He's a menace! This entire area is under the control of him and his mercenary group, the Khazard Army. They prey on the weak and vulnerable, making them fight in that arena of theirs, all for entertainment!
2	line	Player	That's horrible! How are they able to get away with it?
2	line	Lady Servil	The authorities don't care. Khazard's men just pay them off if they ever come to investigate.
2	line	Player	Well they won't stop me. I'm going to try my best to find your family.
2	line	Lady Servil	Thank you. They'll be somewhere inside the arena. I'll be waiting here for you.
2	action	end
1	option	No.
2	line	Player	Well I hope it works out. Good luck.
2	action	end
