0	section	Upon killing the Khazard Ogre
1	line	General Khazard	Well, well, well, you seem to be in quite the rush. Do you have somewhere else to be?
1	line	Sammy Servil	Oh no...
1	line	Player	General Khazard, I presume?
1	line	General Khazard	You presume correct. I must say, I sense a great air of defiance to you. Does my appearance not fill you with fear?
1	line	Player	I've seen worse.
1	line	General Khazard	How arrogant. No matter though, you will come to learn.
1	line	General Khazard	Now, despite your entertaining show, the two individuals you are attempting to leave with are my property.
1	line	Player	They belong to nobody!
1	line	General Khazard	Ha! Well if their freedom is so valuable to you, how about a trade? Fight in my arena, and if you win, I'll let them go.
1	line	Player	And what if I refuse your offer?
1	line	General Khazard	Well... I wasn't actually giving you a choice. Guards, take [him/her/them] to the cells.
1	action	end
