0	section	Talking to Hengrad in the jail cell
1	line	Hengrad	Hello there. So Khazard got his hands on you too?
1	line	Player	Unfortunately so.
1	line	Hengrad	Well if you're lucky, you might last as long as me.
1	line	Player	How long have you been here?
1	line	Hengrad	As long as I can remember. I was a child when his men kidnapped me. My whole life has been spent killing and fighting, all in the hope that one day I might escape.
1	line	Player	Don't give up.
1	line	Hengrad	Thanks, friend.
1	line	Hengrad	Wait... sounds like the guard is coming. Looks like you'll be going back into the arena. Good luck, friend.
1	line	General Khazard	Now watch closely, friends. I fear this may be where your protector dies.
1	line	Justin Servil	Ignore him! You can do it!
1	action	end
0	section	Talking to Hengrad after teleporting out of a fight
