1	line	Hengrad	I don't know how you managed to escape, but you may not be as lucky next time. Get out of here while you can.
1	action	end
0	section	Upon killing the scorpion
1	line	General Khazard	Impressive, but now for a proper challenge. Time for my puppy. Bring on Bouncer!
1	action	end
0	section	Upon killing Bouncer
1	line	General Khazard	Bouncer! No!
1	line	General Khazard	You monster! You'll pay for what you've done!
1	line	Player	I only did what you asked. I fought in your arena. Now let the Servils go.
1	line	General Khazard	Fine! I am not a coward who makes false promises. I have no need of them anyway. You on the other hand, won't be going anywhere.
1	line	General Khazard	Guard, escort the Servils out. I'll take great pleasure in dealing with this one myself!
1	line	Sammy Servil	Don't try to fight him! Just run!
1	action	end
