1	line	Spectator	Hey, you're the one who beat Bouncer! Amazing!
1	action	end
0	section	Upon defeating General Khazard
1	line	General Khazard	Going somewhere?
1	line	Player	But... I killed you!
1	line	General Khazard	Ha! Arrogant fool! You think you can kill me? I am General Khazard! My power is absolute!
1	line	General Khazard	Now, part of me would very much like to kill you for what you've done today, but let it be known that I am not without generosity.
1	line	General Khazard	You proved yourself in battle against me. That is something few can boast of. For that, you may leave. However, if you ever oppose me again, I won't hesitate to wipe you from existence!
1	line	General Khazard	Now go. I have business to attend to elsewhere that is far more important than you.
1	action	end
0	section	Talking to Lady Servil after Khazard attacks
1	line	Player	Lady Servil.
1	line	Lady Servil	You're alive! I feared General Khazard would have killed you!
1	line	Player	He tried, but I escaped.
1	line	Lady Servil	Thank goodness. I'd have never forgiven myself if you'd have died saving my family.
1	line	Lady Servil	Now, you'll be pleased to know that my son and husband are safe and recovering at home. Without you they would certainly be dead. Thank you, for everything.
1	line	Player	It's not a problem.
1	line	Lady Servil	Please, take this payment. It's the least you deserve.
